  refine inj_list _ hch (tot [sp0_lap0 r s u, sp0_lap1 r s u, sp0_lap2 r s u, sp0_lap3 r s u]) le_rfl ?_ i1 i2 (by rw [q0_tot r s u hr hu]; exact h1) (by rw [q0_tot r s u hr hu]; exact h2) e
